==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge]] spawns.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hater]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

